OL,3,GNEWSAUnderpass gets ocean-inspired
OL,4,Amakeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn underpass in Weymouth has been given
OL,7,Fan underwater makeover with vibrant new
OL,8,Fmurals.
OL,10,FThe walkway in Westham by the swannery
OL,11,Fhas been decorated by two artists,
OL,12,Falongside young people from youth and
OL,13,Fchildren's group Hope House.
OL,15,FThe first subway mural has been
OL,16,Ffinished and includes crabs, jellyfish,
OL,17,Fturtles, seahorses, sharks and a large
OL,18,Foctopus. Artwork on the second subway
OL,19,Fis now set to get underway.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
